  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "區塊鏈原理與數位藝術",
    "sub_ename": "BLOCKCHAIN PRINCIPLES AND DIGITAL ART.",
    "describe_ch": "經由學習區塊鏈及NFT之科技趨勢緣起與脈絡，了解新興科技對全球藝術發展之影響與應用，培養學生具有基本科技觀念並能與專業科技領域人員溝通之能力，以有效發掘問題、表達問題進而解決問題。\n數位藝術已是這幾年發展快速的商業模式，希望經由數位藝術、網路行銷及NFT，讓學生認識藝術與行銷不同面相，並了解新興科技對於藝術行銷之改變及創新思維，順利因應未來職場所需之職能。",
    "describe_eh": "By learning the origin and context of the technological trends of blockchain and NFT, students can understand the impact and application of emerging technologies on the development of global art, cultivate their basic technological concepts and the ability to communicate with professionals in the field of technology, so as to effectively discover and express problems and to solve the problem.\nDigital art has been a rapidly developing business model in recent years. It is hoped that through digital art, online marketing and NFT, students can understand the different aspects of art and marketing, and understand the changes and innovative thinking of emerging technologies in art marketing, so as to successfully adapt to the required capabilities in the future workplace.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "能了解數位藝術及行銷相關概念及理論",
      "describe_en": "To understand the concepts and theories related to digital arts and marketing."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "能了解網路行銷之新商業行銷模式",
      "describe_en": " To understand the internet marketing and new business models."
    }
